   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Work in garden set. Man and woman watering seedling, planting trees, picking fruits, harvesting. People concept. Vector illustration for topics like hobby, farming, orchard</rdf:li>
